        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Include a source in proportion to the attention you want to give it. If a source is especially important to your thinking or if you discuss it in detail, include more of it; if you acknowledge it only in passing, include less of it.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                181,
                784,
